#. ja: 「大迷宮バハムート」へ行く？
#. de: Was möchtest du tun?
#. fr: Pénétrer dans le Labyrinthe de Bahamut<nbsp>?
msgctxt "raid/BahamutGuideTravelWild2:TEXT_BAHAMUTGUIDETRAVELWILD2_Q1_000_010:1"
msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr "Что вы хотите сделать?"

#. ja: 「大迷宮バハムート：真成編」の開始条件について聞く
#. de: Die Bedingungen für „Verschlungene Schatten - Finale“ erfahren
#. fr: Savoir comment accéder à l'Abîme de Bahamut
msgctxt "raid/BahamutGuideTravelWild2:TEXT_BAHAMUTGUIDETRAVELWILD2_A1_000_011:1"
msgid "Learn about the Final Coil of Bahamut."
msgstr "Узнать о Последнем витке Бахамута."

#. ja: 「<sheet InstanceContent $n1 3>」を通常ロットで開始
#. de: „<sheet InstanceContent $n1 3>“ mit der Beuteregel „Standard“ beginnen
#. fr: Lancer la mission “<sheet InstanceContent $n1 3>” (normale)
#. macro: <lower-first><sheet InstanceContent $n1 3></lower-first> — the content with its first letter in lower case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet InstanceContent $n1 3> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = InstanceContent, row = number parameter 1, column = 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
