#. macro: <if ($n3 <= 10)><switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n3></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "raid/BahamutGuideTravelWild2:TEXT_BAHAMUTGUIDETRAVELWILD2_A3_000_350:1"
msgid "<if ($n2 == 1)>One member<else><capitalize><if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if><else><num $n2></if></capitalize> members</if> of your party <if ($n2 == 1)>has<else>have</if> already progressed beyond <lower-first><sheet InstanceContent $n1 3></lower-first>. As a result, <if ($n3 == 1)><if $n3><if ($n3 <= 10)><switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n3></if><else><num $n3></if> treasure coffer<else><if $n3><if ($n3 <= 10)><switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n3></if><else><num $n3></if> treasure coffers</if> will pop upon completion. Do you wish to proceed?"
msgstr "<num $n2> участников вашей группы уже прошли дальше, чем <lower-first><sheet InstanceContent $n1 3></lower-first>. Поэтому после завершения появится <num $n3> сундука<if ($n3 == 1)><else>ов</if>. Продолжить?"

